---
import { CheckCircle2, XCircle } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="solusi" class="py-20 border-b border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-950">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4 mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-300">
        <span>ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Kenapa Sebagian Besar Landing Page Gagal Menghasilkan Penjualan?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Kebocoran konversi sering kali bukan karena penawaran Anda buruk, melainkan friksi teknis dan arsitektur data yang tidak ramah audiens smartphone.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900/40 border border-red-950/60 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-950/40 border border-red-900/60 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400">
            <XCircle class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Cara Lama (Konversi Bocor)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Biaya bulanan membengkak & performa lambat</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-zinc-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Loading 4–6 detik di koneksi mobile, membuang hingga 58% budget iklan calon pembeli sebelum membaca tawaran.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Ketergantungan langganan SaaS form bulanan dalam USD yang membatasi kuota kirim lead.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Data leads terserak di notifikasi email, memperlambat kecepatan follow-up tim penjualan.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Rentan spam bot otomatis tanpa filter keamanan terstruktur.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900/70 border border-emerald-900/60 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/80 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
            <CheckCircle2 class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">ElevateGrowth Engine</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-emerald-400/90">Arsitektur modern, instan, & bebas biaya server</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-zinc-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span>Skor 98–100 di PageSpeed Insights mobile: rendering instan tanpa runtime JavaScript yang membebani browser.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span>Zero recurring cost: pipeline langsung ke Google Sheets tanpa biaya langganan bulanan selamanya.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span>Data masuk real-time ke spreadsheet yang bisa dibuka tim sales langsung via aplikasi smartphone.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <span>Proteksi ganda: Honeypot trap anti-bot otomatis dan sanitasi pencegah injection spreadsheet.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
